    "rawUrl": "https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash/resolve/dba1be0a40aa45a94ad051997016db3960a90277/inference/model.py",
    "excerpt": "    def _compress_kv(self, x, qr, start_pos, offset):\n        \"\"\"The shared compressed KV and the compressed positions every query may attend to. This\n        layer compresses its own KV only when it is a source; otherwise it just reads the cache.\"\"\"\n        bsz, seqlen, _ = x.size()\n        ratio = self.compress_ratio\n        compress_len = (start_pos + seqlen) // ratio\n        latent = None\n        if self.is_kv_source:\n            latent = self.compressor(x, start_pos)\n            shared_attn.compress_kv = self.compress_kv_cache",
    "excerptStart": 739,
    "callChain": "generate.py → Transformer.forward → Block.forward → Attention.forward → _compress_kv/_compress_topk_idxs",
    "inputOutput": "input_ids [B,S]及可选图像→隐藏状态与共享KV；forward返回output_ids、logits、main_hidden。",
    "notes": "官方模型定义／推理实现；此文件能前向或计算loss，不等于发布了生成该checkpoint的完整预训练与RL流水线。"
